        "excerpt": "PR: Add `--show-history` flag to `debug  helmrelease` [closed; labels area/helm, area/ux]\nThis pull request adds a new feature to the `flux debug hr` command, allowing users to print the reconciliation history of a Helm release. It also refines the command-line flag validation logic to ensure only one output option is selected at a time. The most important changes are grouped below:\n\n### New Feature\n\n* Added the `--show-history` flag to the `flux debug hr` command, enabling users to print the reconciliation history of a Helm release. This includes documentation and YAML output of the release h…",
